            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A flyer from the Blue Hour. It seems to have passed through many hands judging from how crumpled the paper is."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "On the flyer, an intimate couple is whispering sweet nothings to each other. The airship Radiant Feldspar sailing in the sea of a dream bubble is in the background."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b31b7f725d317b46"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "One by one, the streetlights click alight as the sun sets.\nKeep the song playing and don't let the party stop.\nLet's escape the day!\nAnd dive into the Night of !"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dab5cfaf53d7cf12"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
